# Commit messages

- Sentence case / imperative subject (e.g. `Add …`, `Remove …`, `Use …`)
- **End the subject with a period**
- Concise, one line preferred; optional body only when needed

```text
# bad
Add daisyUI and its agent skill
migrate to Vite+ with Zed editor setup

# good
Add daisyUI and its agent skill.
Migrate to Vite+ with Zed editor setup.
```
